<simplesect kind="return"><para>Return value.</para>
</simplesect>
We intentionally avoid a full JSON parser dependency; we just scan for the first occurrence of &quot;updated_at&quot;:&lt;number&gt; pattern. BATCH B ANNOTATION: Version Tracking: This method extracts a monotonic timestamp that serves as a version vector component for causality tracking. The extracted timestamp represents the write&apos;s logical time in the system and should be propagated to all conflict resolution decision points. Consensus Expectation: All replicas must produce deterministic timestamp extraction from the same JSON payload to ensure convergence. Calls: find(), size(), std::stoll(), substr(), THEMIS_DEBUG(). </para>
        </detaileddescription>
