    <briefdescription>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>Last-Write-Wins conflict resolver based on embedded timestamp field. Selects the document with the higher &quot;updated_at&quot; (milliseconds epoch) in its JSON payload. Falls back to remote on parse errors. </para>
    </detaileddescription>
